{"name": "Bring It", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/b81a6aab8209368c36ea56c725bdec34.webp?t=1787538494\" width=\"162\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Race against the city clock as a motor courier chasing the ultimate score. The faster and cleaner you deliver, the higher your rewards climb. Learn every shortcut, take bonus pickups, pull off stylish boosts and drifts, and stack combos with your Mood Meter to multiply your delivery payouts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/3ccba0e3b9eda10c296b5689baf16a1e.poster.avif?t=1787538494\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/3ccba0e3b9eda10c296b5689baf16a1e.webm?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/3ccba0e3b9eda10c296b5689baf16a1e.mp4?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Complete deliveries with the highest score and claim your spot on the leaderboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/585741a18fa451b10e2d5f8ee27a5e8c.poster.avif?t=1787538494\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/585741a18fa451b10e2d5f8ee27a5e8c.webm?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/585741a18fa451b10e2d5f8ee27a5e8c.mp4?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/640cec205f70bcc59210eaf9d7deb8fe.webp?t=1787538494\" width=\"162\"/></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each new day starts with a unique bonus. These daily modifiers can completely swing your earnings and redefine how you plan your next high-score run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/760aa0f6e4b35efe793f76a78f370237.poster.avif?t=1787538494\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/760aa0f6e4b35efe793f76a78f370237.webm?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/760aa0f6e4b35efe793f76a78f370237.mp4?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy new items to boost your room, choose the bike that fits your style, and start each day with powerful bonuses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/9f9909e22f912e3a30558b79b6a92080.poster.avif?t=1787538494\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/9f9909e22f912e3a30558b79b6a92080.webm?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/9f9909e22f912e3a30558b79b6a92080.mp4?t=1787538494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/3edbedc0ad9a70381f26d3c8fb1d5925.avif?t=1787538494\" width=\"983\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/54aa48d56dad8f05c6b77a9ddef65a9a.gif?t=1787538494\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146080/extras/54aa48d56dad8f05c6b77a9ddef65a9a.poster.avif?t=1787538494\"/></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A stylized retro arcade game about a motor courier hustling through the city to deliver meals, coffee and groceries with skill and style. Chai